  "name": "Chalets on the golf course, Barsebäck",
  "blurb": "Home for BDT 2015 – 15 tourists, with PGA National Lakes Course, Barseback Masters and Barseback Donald Steel on the golf schedule.\n\nChalets on the course at Barsebäck Golf & Country Club, founded in 1969 on the Öresund coast north of Malmö. The club has two 18-hole courses, Ocean and Pine, plus a nine-hole course. It hosted the 2003 Solheim Cup and has staged the Scandinavian Masters ten times.",
